Source: cat-tools
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/decibel/cat_tools

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-cat-tools
Architecture: all
Provides: postgresql-cat-tools
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Tools for interfacing with the PostgreSQL catalog
 cat_tools provides SQL functions and views for inspecting and working with
 PostgreSQL system catalogs.
